I posted the bullets for the note to June as a reply in #coastal-team. Nothing has been sent to June.

The bullets cover:
- the PHL label confusion;
- the 16 Feb rename from Covey & Lark to Pellow Home Living;
- the saved report that still reads "Covey — Late Arrivals";
- the risk that people won't realise that report is PHL's;
- an ask for June to confirm whether the report should be renamed and who owns that.

The facts come from your message. I didn't check them against Moss's digest. I can draft a mail to June if you want one.
